Hundred Rabbits"]}]]}],["$","p","1-Rekka Bellum and Devine Lu Linvega make software, games, books, music, tools, and other things while living aboard a sailboat and thinking seriously about technological resilience. Their line—“That which cannot be repaired is already broken”—has been lodged in my head since I found it.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["Rekka Bellum and Devine Lu Linvega make software, games, books, music, tools, and other things while living aboard a sailboat and thinking seriously about technological resilience. Their line—“That which cannot be repaired is already broken”—has been lodged in my head since I found it."]}],["$","p","2-[A Working Library](https://aworkinglibrary.com/)",{"className":"$undefined","children":[["$","a","0",{"href":"https://aworkinglibrary.com/","rel":"noreferrer","children":["A Working Library"]}]]}],["$","p","3-Mandy Brown’s ongoing library of reading, work, technology, and thought. The site feels accumulated rather than produced. Books lead to notes, notes lead elsewhere, and the whole thing remains visibly in use.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["Mandy Brown’s ongoing library of reading, work, technology, and thought. The site feels accumulated rather than produced. Books lead to notes, notes lead elsewhere, and the whole thing remains visibly in use."]}],["$","p","4-[Scope of Work](https://www.scopeofwork.net/)",{"className":"$undefined","children":[["$","a","0",{"href":"https://www.scopeofwork.net/","rel":"noreferrer","children":["Scope of Work"]}]]}],["$","p","5-Work in its unusually broad sense: tools, machinery, maintenance, competence, labor, curiosity, and the reasons people become interested in doing difficult things well.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["Work in its unusually broad sense: tools, machinery, maintenance, competence, labor, curiosity, and the reasons people become interested in doing difficult things well."]}],["$","p","6-[Low-tech Magazine](https://solar.lowtechmagazine.com/)",{"className":"$undefined","children":[["$","a","0",{"href":"https://solar.lowtechmagazine.com/","rel":"noreferrer","children":["Low-tech Magazine"]}]]}],"$Ld","$Le","$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24"],null]}],null,"$L25"]}]]}]}]
